{
 "hook-1": {
  "start": 0,
  "duration": 306,
  "audioFrames": 298,
  "audioSec": 9.933,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "上一期我们在后厨放了一张备菜台，让出菜更快。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.22
   },
   {
    "text": "可到了双十一零点，成千上万的人同时下单，后厨再快也做不过来。",
    "start": 4.5,
    "dur": 5.434
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:hook-1"
 },
 "hook-2": {
  "start": 306,
  "duration": 337,
  "audioFrames": 327,
  "audioSec": 10.9,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 306,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "奇怪的是，网站没有直接崩掉，你的订单也没有丢。",
    "start": 0.014,
    "dur": 4.848
   },
   {
    "text": "这背后靠的，是一条排好的队。",
    "start": 5.142,
    "dur": 3.409
   },
   {
    "text": "这一期，就来讲讲这条队。",
    "start": 8.831,
    "dur": 2.075
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:hook-2"
 },
 "sync-1": {
  "start": 643,
  "duration": 338,
  "audioFrames": 330,
  "audioSec": 11.0,
  "chapter": "sync",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "先看不排队会怎样。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 1.786
   },
   {
    "text": "前台每收一单，就站在那里等后厨做完，才去接下一位。",
    "start": 2.066,
    "dur": 4.332
   },
   {
    "text": "这种一单等一单的做法，技术上叫同步。",
    "start": 6.678,
    "dur": 4.306
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:sync-1"
 },
 "sync-2": {
  "start": 981,
  "duration": 387,
  "audioFrames": 377,
  "audioSec": 12.567,
  "chapter": "sync",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 338,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "人一多，前台越堵越长，后厨被挤得手忙脚乱，有的单子干脆就弄丢了。",
    "start": -0.003,
    "dur": 6.167
   },
   {
    "text": "网站也是一样：每个请求都要等后面处理完才回话，人一多，整个系统就卡住了。",
    "start": 6.444,
    "dur": 6.126
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:sync-2"
 },
 "async-1": {
  "start": 1368,
  "duration": 322,
  "audioFrames": 313,
  "audioSec": 10.433,
  "chapter": "async",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "办法是取号叫号。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.321
   },
   {
    "text": "客人下单，前台先把单子写成一张号单，放进叫号的队伍里，马上告诉客人：已收到，请稍等。",
    "start": 2.601,
    "dur": 7.842
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:async-1"
 },
 "async-2": {
  "start": 1690,
  "duration": 315,
  "audioFrames": 305,
  "audioSec": 10.167,
  "chapter": "async",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 322,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "不用等菜做好，就能接下一位，这叫异步。",
    "start": -0.01,
    "dur": 4.061
   },
   {
    "text": "这条装着号单、按顺序排好的队，就叫消息队列，简称 MQ。",
    "start": 4.331,
    "dur": 5.827
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:async-2"
 },
 "peak-1": {
  "start": 2005,
  "duration": 277,
  "audioFrames": 269,
  "audioSec": 8.967,
  "chapter": "peak",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "再看高峰。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 1.098
   },
   {
    "text": "假设一分钟涌来一万单，后厨一分钟只能做一千单。",
    "start": 1.378,
    "dur": 4.551
   },
   {
    "text": "没有队列，后厨当场就被冲垮。",
    "start": 6.209,
    "dur": 2.755
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:peak-1"
 },
 "peak-2": {
  "start": 2282,
  "duration": 358,
  "audioFrames": 348,
  "audioSec": 11.6,
  "chapter": "peak",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 277,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "有了队列，单子先排着，后厨按自己的节奏一单一单做，高峰过去再慢慢消化完。",
    "start": 0.011,
    "dur": 7.466
   },
   {
    "text": "把突然冲上来的尖峰压平，这就叫削峰。",
    "start": 7.757,
    "dur": 3.833
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:peak-2"
 },
 "producer-1": {
  "start": 2640,
  "duration": 361,
  "audioFrames": 329,
  "audioSec": 10.967,
  "chapter": "producer",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "往队里放单的前台，叫生产者；从队里取单去做的后厨，叫消费者。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.263
   },
   {
    "text": "还有一个关键：单子要等菜真正做完，才从队里划掉。",
    "start": 6.543,
    "dur": 4.422
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:producer-1",
  "origDuration": 337,
  "extraHold": 24,
  "holdAt": 337
 },
 "producer-2": {
  "start": 2977,
  "duration": 313,
  "audioFrames": 303,
  "audioSec": 10.1,
  "chapter": "producer",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 337,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "万一后厨中途出了错，号单还在，换个厨师接着做，单子就不会丢。",
    "start": 0.012,
    "dur": 5.718
   },
   {
    "text": "常用的工具，一个叫 Kafka，一个叫 RabbitMQ。",
    "start": 6.01,
    "dur": 4.095
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep9-timing.json:producer-2"
 },
 "recap-1": {
